This model is a fine-tune of Edge0/Audio8-ASR-0.1B, which is licensed under
CC BY-NC 4.0. That licence permits adaptation and redistribution for non-commercial
purposes with attribution, and its non-commercial restriction carries through to this
work. This release is therefore non-commercial, and cannot be relicensed for commercial
use by us or by anyone else downstream.

Audio8-ASR-0.1B is itself built on the Qwen3-ASR audio encoder and the
Ref-Pretrain-Qwen-104M language model backbone.

